### 1. Get all stocks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stocks

### 2. Search for specific stocks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stocks/0050

### 3. Add a new stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol" : "2330",
  "companyName" : "台積電",
  "industry" : "半導體業",
  "isActive" : true
}

### 4. Update stock information
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/stocks/0050
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName" : "元大台灣50",
  "industry" : "ETF",
  "isActive" : true
}
